    "_summary": "A version of the classic arcade game made 100% with PlayMaker.",
    "_description": "# Maze Chase\n\nA re-creation of the classic arcade game.\n\n{height=300}![screenshot](Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker/Editor/Addons/Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker.samples.maze-chase.jpg)\n\n## Features\n\n### 2D Pathfinding\n\n- Uses PlayMaker's native [NavGrid](docs:components/#navgrid-system) system.\n- Tilemaps baked into a NavGrid using [NavGridBaker](docs:components/nav-grid-baker/).\n- Ghosts pathfind using a [NavGridAgent](docs:components/nav-grid-agent/) and [NavGrid actions](docs:actions/nav-grid-actions/).\n- Player moves using [NavGridAgent](docs:components/nav-grid-agent/) Manual mode.\n\n\n### Notes\n\n- Doesn't use any physics collisions.",
